+"""G13 / Step 4.7b: `canonical_player_uid` is NOT part of the public API any more.
+
+What these tests pin down:
+  1. the public contract and the generated OpenAPI have no uid property at all (contract 0.5.0-draft);
+  2. no real response (all 7 built endpoints, search listings, error bodies) contains the key or the REAL uuid values of the internal uids;
+  3. the INTERNAL uid is untouched (players.player_uid, the read model, every repository join) - this is not an over-removal;
+  4. `p:<uuid>` is still invalid everywhere and `ea:<id>` is still the only public id."""
